---
---
<section class="cta-section">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="cta-card">
			<div class="cta-content">
				<h2 class="cta-title">¿Tenés dudas sobre nuestros planes?</h2>
				<p class="cta-subtitle">Comunicate por WhatsApp y un asesor te ayudará a elegir la mejor opción. Sin vueltas, directo al punto.</p>
				<button class="btn-cta-whatsapp">
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined">chat</span>
					Consultar planes
				</button>
			</div>
			<div class="floating-blobs">
				<div class="blob blue"></div>
				<div class="blob green"></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.cta-section {
		padding: var(--spacing-24) 0;
		background: #fff;
	}

	.cta-card {
		background: #f3f4f6; /* Gray background as Reference */
		border-radius: 2.5rem;
		padding: 5rem 2rem;
		text-align: center;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
	}

	.cta-content {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
	}

	.cta-title {
		font-size: 3rem;
		color: #111827;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
	}

	.cta-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		color: #4b5563;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		max-width: 36rem;
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.btn-cta-whatsapp {
		background: var(--color-primary); /* #25D366 */
		color: white;
		padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		font-family: var(--font-headline);
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		border: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.2);
	}

	.btn-cta-whatsapp:hover {
		transform: translateY(-4px);
		box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.3);
	}

	.floating-blobs {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 1;
	}

	.blob {
		position: absolute;
		width: 20rem;
		height: 20rem;
		filter: blur(80px);
		opacity: 0.1;
	}

	.blue {
		background: var(--color-secondary);
		top: -10rem;
		right: -10rem;
	}

	.green {
		background: var(--color-primary);
		bottom: -10rem;
		left: -10rem;
	}
</style>
